          "title": "You'll want to know: বাধ্যতামূলক",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাধ্যতামূলক — bādhyôtāmūlôk — \"compulsory\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গাড়ি চালালে লাইসেন্স রাখা বাধ্যতামূলক। gāṛi chālāle lāisens rākhā bādhyôtāmūlôk. If you drive, you must carry a licence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাধ্যতামূলক (bādhyôtāmūlôk) is a modern Bengali formation: Sanskrit bādhya, 'to be pressed or constrained', made abstract with -tā, and mūlaka, 'rooted in' (Monier-Williams): rooted in obligation, required."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
