          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অনুমতি (ônumôti) is Sanskrit anumati, assent or permission (Monier-Williams). It is asked for with চাওয়া and given with দেওয়া."
            }
          ]
        },
