              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "চাপানো (chāpāno) is the causative of চাপা 'to press' (CDIAL 4674, a reconstructed capp, lists Bengali cāpā): to press a load, a tax or a rule down on someone. The one who bears it takes -এর ওপর."
